---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — StudyRoadmap™" description="StudyRoadmap™ privacy policy. We collect no personal data. Your exam choices stay on your device.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://studyroadmap.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Privacy Policy","item":"https://studyroadmap.in/privacy/"}]})}>
  </script>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-950 border-b border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800">
      <div class="container-page py-14 text-center">
        <h1 class="heading-1 text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50">Privacy Policy</h1>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="container-page py-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Effective date:</strong> 28 May 2026</p>
        <p>StudyRoadmap™ is built with privacy as a core principle. We collect <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">as little data as possible</strong>.</p>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">What We Collect</h2>
          <p>We currently run <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">no first-party analytics</strong>. We do not deploy Google Analytics, Plausible, or any other analytics script on this site at this time. Our self-hosted nginx server logs standard request metadata (IP, user-agent, referrer) in its access logs for security and operations; we do not retain or correlate that data for tracking.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">We do not use tracking pixels or personal data collection of our own. We don't know who you are, what exam you're preparing for, or how long you're studying. If we enable a privacy-friendly analytics service in the future, this page will be updated before it goes live.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
          <p>We use your browser's <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">local storage</strong> to save your exam selection and duration preferences. This data stays entirely on your device and is never sent to any server. StudyRoadmap™ itself sets no first-party tracking cookies. However, third-party advertising partners (see the Advertising section below) may set their own cookies when ads are displayed. You can clear local storage and cookies at any time from your browser settings, and you can opt out of personalised ad cookies using the links in the Advertising section.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Your Data Rights</h2>
          <p>Because we collect no personal data, there is no data to access, correct, or delete — it was never here to begin with. If you have concerns about the request metadata recorded in our server access logs, please contact us at the addresses below.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>We self-host the site on an <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">nginx</strong> server and use <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Google Fonts</strong> (fonts.googleapis.com, fonts.gstatic.com) for typography. Google receives a request log (IP, user-agent) each time a font asset loads, governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>. Our server records basic request data (IP, user-agent) in standard access logs as part of normal operations and security monitoring. If we display ads via <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Google AdSense</strong>, EEA, UK, and Swiss visitors will see a Google-provided consent prompt for personalised advertising in line with UK/EU GDPR. You retain the right to access, correct, erase, restrict, port, or object to processing of any personal data held by these providers — contact us at the email below and we will route the request.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Advertising</h2>
          <p>We may display advertisements through third-party advertising networks such as <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Google AdSense</strong>. These networks may use cookies and web beacons to serve ads based on your prior visits to our site or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">Google Ad Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">We do not control or have access to any information collected by third-party advertisers. Please review their respective privacy policies for more information.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Our site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect any information from anyone under 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided personal information through our site, please contact us so we can take appropriate action.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy occasionally. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, reach out to us:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>
              <a href="mailto:pushkersaini@gmail.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline dark:text-brand-400">
                pushkersaini@gmail.com
              </a>
              — for privacy questions and data requests
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/feedback/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline dark:text-brand-400">
                Submit feedback
              </a>
              — for bug reports and feature suggestions
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
